VU1 chain: specialize the ordinary path without diagnostic bookkeeping.
Select the detailed implementation when VU cost, opcode or native counters are
enabled. Both implementations retain the same guest cycle/flag/lane/history,
stop and budget behavior. No environment opt-in or generated-block ABI change.
Validation and hardware scope: docs/research/vu1-chain-2026-11-09.md.

--- a/PS2Recomp/ps2xRuntime/src/lib/vu/ps2_vu1_native.inl
